data: {"id": "eeca023218ba44aa-thinking-parallel_evidence-317", "run_id": "eeca023218ba44aa", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，我将执行第一轮并行工具调用，以获取 `aiops-case-v01/workload` 的完整实时证据。\n\n### 第一轮工具调用执行\n\n**Kubernetes 证据:**\n\n1.  **Pod Describe & Events**: 获取 Pod 的详细状态、Conditions 和 Events，确认 Pending 的原因。\n    *   `kubectl_describe` pod workload in aiops-case-v01\n2.  **Pod YAML**: 获取 Pod 的资源请求和调度约束（nodeSelector/affinity）。\n    *   `kubectl_get_yaml` pod workload in aiops-case-v01\n3.  **Node Resources**: 获取集群节点的资源概况，用于后续与 Pod Request 对比。\n    *   `run_bash_command` kubectl get nodes -o json | jq '[.items[] | {name: .metadata.name, ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789105019723, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

